<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-21T07:52:24.310Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:52:24 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamic State-affiliated militants attacked civilians in eastern Mali, killing dozens, while separate gunmen attacks in Mali killed over 40 civilians. In Niger, gunmen assaulted a bus, killing at least 11 passengers. Burkina Faso's military junta reinstated the death penalty amid the escalating jihadist insurgency. The conflict, ongoing since 2012, continues to affect Mali, Niger and Burkina Faso. The war caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNRUtIWld5N3BET19pMlNadlkyRjc0MWlOVWk5MVg4WXNxdFFFYVVGSGZCT2RFRkFqdWppa0JualdldnR1R3Z4bGxqVDJ2MXgxeWktT3hPdHQ5cm0zSVhBWEEweF8yZkNaVkZYcTQ4bkUyZWdBRi1BNWlKTDRyd0pQMGM0ZUJxV0N1SEdXZ3UyTGdyTktvRkdDcE13?oc=5&quot;&gt;THISDAYLIVE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE1iWTduSU9Bd2FGUktFYTNKalc1QlBuUWhGcnR2RWg4dGRXeDYzVGo5WFgyYmMwaHRnOFBnTFBUQXNOeDVyUmpDSjI2UzByQVgyZmVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;شبكة تواصل الإخبارية&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPNFBMekV5d2JDQ2MzUnAzYUFqdHNBRWNOd0lZVU1PTV9SNEhERGhJWlN6allGcTVIWHVsMlFZV0pqY1MtbmxyTHNaYjdWMzB4R3VEdDZZQTd2dW53RURhelNDRm1fYnpjWmlGYUlSdUtTbHM5VHpjRzNObFZCSGZlbWtnUmh0cS1zUXJLMGhscHdIOWtFa1ZpTmtCSmhTWU1YNFF0MDZEcUhBSkU?oc=5&quot;&gt;streamlinefeed.co.ke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxNdmdPbTRsc2QtSkdYSG1ncUNoY3V6aFV3TVIycEFMa1NyNG5zc09ic1dGUDVfa1dFRk5vT3ZHcUZCbTdSb2YxdE85NVEyQlhSOGN2SU9CSDZRVXJBWjFiU05UNjllUHY5M2E4cjBRMTJoeUxiNkp2ZHNoZUNYLXlBSTdfaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNRlAzMTVwWXpjQ3Z4RzIyck12Y1djMDh6a3QzVVRZOWVWN21JRGJzRVk2ZURQYjk0MVhTWVlmVGtNMnRP